    <article id="ts-room-panel" class="ts-room-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="ts-tab-lab" aria-live="polite">
      <span class="ts-room-index" data-ts-index>01 / LAB</span>
      <h3 data-ts-title>A place to do the work.</h3>
      <p data-ts-copy>
        Mentored research projects organized around consequential questions, credible methods, and the expectation that participants act as researchers—not assistants waiting at the edge of the room.
